TI  - Engineering Sustainable Agents: A Systematic Comparison of Agentic LLMs for Developer Workflows
AU  - Merve Astekin
AU  - Yan Naing Tun
AU  - Arda Göknil
AU  - Erik Johannes Husom
AU  - Lwin Khin Shar
AU  - Hasan Sözer
AU  - Ratnadira Widyasari
