TI  - SmartDecompiler-R1: Enhancing Faithful and Explainable Smart Contract Bytecode Decompilation with Reinforcement Learning
AU  - Yilun Ma
AU  - Lingxiao Tang
AU  - Li Gang Lin
AU  - Zhipeng Gao
AU  - Jiachi Chen
AU  - Xin Xia
