TI  - ReproBench: Benchmarking LLM Agents on Reproducing Vulnerability From Scratch
AU  - Liang He
AU  - Sheng Wu
AU  - Haomiao Hao
AU  - Hongduo Zhao
AU  - Jia Yan
AU  - Purui Su
T2  - arXiv (Cornell University)
PY  - 2026
