TI  - Trustworthy large language models (LLMs) for power-system operations: From “Grid Copilots” to verifiable decision support
AU  - Mohamad Fani Sulaima
AU  - Arora Jyotsna
AU  - Lukáš Herout
AU  - Ignacio Perez Gálvez
