TI  - Ethical and governance challenges of large language models in power and energy systems: a review and framework for responsible AI deployment
AU  - Mohamad Fani Sulaima
AU  - Sunny Arora
AU  - Ondřej Krejcar
AU  - Lukáš Herout
AU  - Hamidreza Namazi
T2  - Energy Nexus
PY  - 2026
