TI  - A comprehensive survey of communication technologies, security frameworks, and intelligent architectures for medical internet of things and quantum-enabled healthcare
AU  - Abdelhamied A. Ateya
AU  - Mohammed A. ELAffendi
AU  - Mohamed Adel Hammad
T2  - Discover Internet of Things
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026-10-08
