TI  - HazardWeaver: Scientific Route Selection for Hazard Analysis Agents
AU  - Wangshu Zhu
AU  - Xueqi Cheng
AU  - Liang Wu
AU  - Yushun Dong
T2  - arXiv
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026-10-02
