TI  - One Pipeline Does Not Fit All: TAILOR, a Type- and State-Aware Framework for CVE Reproduction
AU  - Ji He
AU  - Huang Zhang
AU  - Lijie Zheng
AU  - Lele Zheng
AU  - Yulong Shen
T2  - arXiv
PY  - 2026
